From 3c7a5b0c3bc1e22a77c5fdbcf0c6df7d6cb8b880 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 19:40:05 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 60/61] Post-game: Sevii 4-7 and rematch levels, held-item shop

- Sevii Islands 4-7 trainers (and their rematches) 1.3x, wild 1.35x;
  post-Champion route rematch tiers 1.25x; trainer Pokemon evolve where
  the new level allows. tools/hack/postgame_levels.py.
- The Trainer Tower lobby shop sells competitive held items (Leftovers,
  Choice Band, type boosters...). tools/hack/held_item_shop.py.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JQmLEZftLdDmGYX3wiQ71G
---
 HACK_NOTES.md                            |   35 +-
 data/maps/TrainerTower_Lobby/scripts.inc |   26 +
 include/hack_version.h                   |    2 +-
 src/data/items.json                      |   48 +-
 src/data/trainer_parties.h               | 1015 +++--
 src/data/wild_encounters.json            | 4534 +++++++++++-----------
 tools/hack/held_item_shop.py             |   41 +
